    "preamble": "Amul Cooperative Milk Federation vs Union Territory Of J And K And Anr on 17 December, 2024 Author: Rajnesh Oswal Bench: Rajnesh Oswal S.No.52 Regular List IN THE HIGH COURT 0F JAMMU & KASHMIR AND LADAKH AT SRINAGAR WP(C) 3210/2023 CM(7708/2023) CM(1017/2024) AMUL COOPERATIVE MILK FEDERATION ...Petitioner(s)/Appellant(s) LIMITED Through: Mr. Mir Reyaz Ahmad, Advocate Vs. UNION TERRITORY OF J AND K AND ANR. ...Respondent(s) Through: Mr. Alla Ud Din Ganai, AAG with Ms. Shaila Shameem, Advocate CORAM: HON'BLE MR. JUSTICE RAJNESH OSWAL, JUDGE ORDER 17-12-2024 1. The petitioner is aggrieved of the order dated 14th November, 2023 passed by Adjudicating Officer under Food, Safety and Standard Act, 2006. Amul Cooperative Milk Federation vs Union Territory Of J And K And Anr on 17 December, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/119353668/ 1 3.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "The sole contention raised by the petitioner is that once the Adjudicating Authority had observed that the petitioner had not committed any offence, no penalty could have been imposed upon the petitioner."
  },
